nd unavailable\\n1099:Windows path resolution and golden `digest_path_v1` projection are available,\\n1101:and Windows conformance lane land; lexical path evidence does not advertise\\n1102:Windows storage support.\\n2010:native-Windows `conpty` requirement, discharged by\\n2011:`TestEveryPinnedReaderHasPositiveNativeWindowsAndWSL2Lanes`), three are\\n===\\ndeterminism_test.go\\ndigest_sweep_test.go\\ndiscovery_test.go\\ndoc.go\\nduplicate_test.go\\nenumeration_test.go\\nfake_test.go\\nos_test.go\\nos_unix.go\\nos_windows.go\\nos.go\\nowner_root_test.go\\nprovider.go\\nrefusal_inventory_test.go\\nsource_inventory_test.go\\ntrust_sources_test.go\\ntrust_test.go\\n./LOGBOOK.md\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1524,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 381,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
